<title>USA: CAI Wireless to outsource work, remove jobs.</title>
<headline>CAI Wireless to outsource work, remove jobs.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CAI Wireless Systems Inc said Monday that it would subcontract installation and service work to outside contractors, resulting in an elimination of 18 percent of the company's workforce.</p>
</text>
